#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:1
msgid "RTK 状态与固定解验证"
msgstr "RTK Status and Fixed-Solution Verification"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:3
msgid "核心判断方法"
msgstr "Core Judgment Method"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:6
msgid ""
"普通用户无需查看设备内部差分链路状态。先确认**定位数据持续输出**，再在开阔环"
"境确认进入 **RTK 固定解**；满足这两项即可判断当前差分通信链路正常。"
msgstr ""
"Most users do not need to inspect the internal correction-link status. "
"Verify **continuous positioning output**, then confirm an **RTK fixed "
"solution** with an open sky view. Together, these results confirm that the "
"correction link is working."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:9
msgid ""
"RTK 首次固定时间为 45 s。验证时应确保天空视野开阔，且差分源和通信链路正常。"
msgstr ""
"RTK time to first fix is 45 s. Perform the check with an open sky view and a "
"working correction source and communication link."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:11
msgid "验证顺序"
msgstr "Verification order"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:13
msgid "**确认定位输出**：数据持续刷新，协议与出厂固件一致。"
msgstr ""
"**Verify positioning output**: Data updates continuously and matches the "
"factory firmware protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**选择查看工具**：NMEA 按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`查看；"
"UBX 使用飞控地面站、遥控器、QGroundControl 或其他兼容设备查看。"
msgstr ""
"**Select a monitoring tool**: For NMEA, follow {ref}`Connect NavStarTool "
"<connect-navstartool>`. For UBX, use a flight-controller ground station, "
"remote controller, QGroundControl, or another compatible device."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:15
msgid "**检查卫星状态**：将设备置于开阔环境，确认卫星数和定位数据持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"**Check satellite status**: Place the receiver with an open sky view and "
"verify continuous satellite and positioning updates."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:16
msgid "**观察解状态**：确认进入 RTK 固定解，部分软件显示为 `Fixed`。"
msgstr ""
"**Check the solution status**: Verify an RTK fixed solution; some tools "
"display `Fixed`."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:17
msgid "**确认稳定性**：固定解和位置输出没有频繁中断。"
msgstr ""
"**Verify stability**: The fixed solution and positioning output do not drop "
"repeatedly."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:19
msgid "成功判据"
msgstr "Success Criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "RTK 链路验证通过"
msgstr "RTK link verification passed"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:24
msgid "定位数据持续输出。"
msgstr "Positioning output remains continuous."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:25
msgid "开阔环境下显示 **RTK 固定解**，且状态保持稳定。"
msgstr ""
"The receiver reports a stable **RTK fixed solution** with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:28
msgid "无法进入固定解时"
msgstr "Unable to reach a steady solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "现象"
msgstr "Phenomenon"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "优先检查"
msgstr "Priority check"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "无串口数据"
msgstr "No serial port data"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "供电、共地、TX/RX、波特率和固件输出"
msgstr "Power supply, common ground, TX/RX, baud rate, and firmware output"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "有数据但无定位"
msgstr "Has data but no positioning"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "GNSS 天线视野、遮挡和安装位置"
msgstr "GNSS antenna field of view, obstructions, and installation location"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "4G 差分无效"
msgstr "4G corrections unavailable"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "SIM 卡、网络覆盖、CORS 账号和 4G 天线"
msgstr "SIM card, network coverage, CORS account, and 4G antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "LoRa 差分无效"
msgstr "LoRa corrections unavailable"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "基站供电、基站是否移动、两端天线和链路遮挡"
msgstr ""
"Base station power supply, whether the base station is mobile, antennas at "
"both ends, and link obstruction"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "可进入浮点解但固定解不稳定"
msgstr "Can reach float solution but fixed-point solution is unstable"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:21
msgid "天空视野、多路径、差分链路质量和现场干扰"
msgstr "Sky view, multipath, correction link quality, and on-site interference"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md:38
msgid "详细处理流程见[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For a detailed handling process, see [Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/"
"troubleshooting.md)."

#~ msgid "对应工具中的卫星数和定位信息持续更新。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The number of satellites and positioning information in the corresponding "
#~ "tool are continuously updated."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "进入 RTK 固定解即表明当前差分通信链路正常；无需查找设备内部链路状态字段。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Entering RTK fixed solution indicates that the current correction link is "
#~ "normal; there is no need to check the internal link status field of the "
#~ "device."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "RTK 首次固定的标准值为 45 s，实际过程仍会受到天空视野、卫星分布、差分源、"
#~ "网络或 LoRa 链路、基站状态和现场环境影响。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The specified RTK first-fix time is 45 s. Actual time depends on sky "
#~ "view, satellite geometry, the correction source, network or LoRa link, "
#~ "base-station status, and site conditions."
